# Decrypted / in-flight Flex statements. The repo is public and Pages serves the
# whole personal_site directory, so raw IBKR XML must never be committable: it
# carries the unmasked account id, every position, and every cash transaction --
# precisely what mask_account() in scripts/ibkr-flex/fetch-ibkr.py exists to keep
# off the site. CI stages plaintext on the runner's temp disk and only ever
# writes ciphertext here; this is the second line of defence for local runs that
# point IBKR_FLEX_RAW_DIR somewhere inside the checkout.
*.xml.gz
warehouse/flex-raw/plain/

# ...but the encrypted archive itself is the point, so keep it.
!warehouse/flex-raw/*.xml.gz.enc
